WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.700
We literally have the 9-1-1 audio of this stand-down order in Chicago, and we have documented

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:12.480
inside of DHS every single unresponded to 9-1-1 call over the recent weeks and months.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.400
Do you have evidence that this campaign is coordinated?

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.120
Are you planning charges on anyone who is actually coordinating said campaign?

